    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Of course, faith can express itself in more ways than venerating a single deity—or a deity at all. A few examples of non-deific religions and philosophies are presented below."
        }
      ],
      "indent": "none",
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 3,
